	["The key %s opens MoveAnything! now."] = "%s ouvre désormais MoveAnything!.",
	["Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one."] = "Commandes : /move (panneau), /move FrameName (déplacer), /move pick (choisir), /move hide FrameName (masquer/afficher), /move done (terminer), /unmove FrameName (réinitialiser), /move key <key> (raccourci), /movelist (liste), /movecopy Name (copier), /movedelete Name (supprimer).",
