	["Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one."] = "コマンド：/move（画面）、/move FrameName（移動）、/move pick（選択）、/move hide FrameName（表示切替）、/move done（完了）、/unmove FrameName（リセット）、/move key <key>（キー）、/movelist（一覧）、/movecopy Name（コピー）、/movedelete Name（削除）。",
	["Type /movecopy Name. /movelist shows the names."] = "/movecopy Name を使用。一覧：/movelist。",
	["Type /movedelete Name. /movelist shows the names."] = "/movedelete Name を使用。一覧：/movelist。",
	["Language: %s"] = "言語：%s",
	["Choose a language. Applies immediately. Automatic follows the game language."] = "言語を選ぶとすぐに反映されます。「自動」はゲームの言語に従います。",
	["Language set to %s."] = "言語を%sに設定しました。",
	["Unknown language. Use /move lang auto, en, pl, cs, de, pt, es, fr, ro, tr, ru, uk, zh, ja or ko."] = "不明な言語です。選択肢：/move lang auto, en, pl, cs, de, pt, es, fr, ro, tr, ru, uk, zh, ja, ko。",
	["The frame \"%s\" is protected."] = "フレーム「%s」は保護されています。",
};
